heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"1. Craft a Strategic Vision for AI Integration","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"AI BDRs can help with a lot of things, from boosting lead quality to creating a smoother experience with personalized messages and timely follow-ups. But before deciding where to use them, take a step back and ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"look at your business goalsâ€”or, more specifically, whatâ€™s holding you back from reaching them.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Are you consistently missing your lead quota? Maybe you're hitting it but dealing with poor lead quality? Or are you trying to enter a new market but donâ€™t have enough manpower?Â ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"AI BDRs can help with any of these, but you need to be clear on which goal youâ€™re focusing on.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Mind that AI BDRs wonâ€™t deliver overnight results. Youâ€™ll usually need 3-6 months to see real progress and decide whether to stick with your current approach or make adjustments. And to track that progress, youâ€™ll need to set ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"measurable","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" objectives for your AI BDRs.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"5P9xxo5Ixu5rQntWlDXBYQ","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-10-21T20:57:42.425Z","updatedAt":"2024-10-21T20:57:42.425Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":9,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"AVA-3","description":"A circle containing the words \"AI BDR\" next to ovals reading: automate 70% of cold emails, back 100 sales calls, increase lead conversion rates by 10%, improve lead engagement rate by 20%, forward 200 sales-qualified leads to AEs, contact 5,000 leads","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/5P9xxo5Ixu5rQntWlDXBYQ/556d99d3affb1fb2682993f0b1ac7eed/AVA-3.webp","details":{"size":163420,"image":{"width":3053,"height":1350}},"fileName":"AVA-3.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If you already have a BDR team and know where your gaps are, your goals might look like \"automate 70% of follow-up emails next quarter\" or \"increase lead conversion rates by 10% in 6 months.\" Or, if youâ€™re just launching a go-to-market (GTM) strategy, you could aim for \"booking 100 sales calls in the first three months\" or \"forwarding 200 sales-qualified leads to sales reps.\"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The choice is yours, just make sure your objectives align with and support your broader business goals. Setting clear, measurable targets will help keep your AI BDR implementation on track and contribute to long-term success.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2. Conduct a Comprehensive Needs Assessment","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Once youâ€™ve nailed down your goals, itâ€™s time to figure out","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" how youâ€™ll achieve them.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"For example, if you aim to forward more engaged leads to your AEs, youâ€™ll want to concentrate on increasing lead volume. But, if youâ€™re looking to boost the number of sales calls through AI, simply increasing lead quantity may not be the best approachâ€”instead, you might need to focus on crafting highly personalized emails.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Depending on your needs, you may decide to implement AI BDRs across any of these functions:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Lead generation: ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"If your team spends too much time researching leads, an AI BDR can quickly scan databases and qualify prospects based on your ICP.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outreach:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" If your BDRs struggle with scaling outreach, AI BDRs can automate personalized email or social media sequences across thousands of leads.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Data management:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" If your lead data is a mess, AI BDRs can handle that, too. They will enrich lead profiles by pulling in additional data points, organize the information for easier tracking, score leads based on engagement, and provide analytics to help you prioritize high-value prospects.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nIdentifying the specific areas where you want to use AI in BDR will help you define the features youâ€™ll be looking for in your AI BDR software. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"On that noteâ€¦","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"3. Choose the Right AI BDR Tool for Your Needs","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Now that you know where you want to use AI BDRs and what your goals are, it's time to select the software that will help you achieve those.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"First, make a list of must-have features based on your earlier assessment, and use it as a guide when evaluating potential tools.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Generally, solid AI sales automation software should include:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A vast database of high-quality leads","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Lead discovery and enrichment","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Email personalization","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Multi-channel sequences","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Automated follow-up","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Built-in outbound CRM","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Sales playbooks","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Writing style self-optimization","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Automatic email warmup","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Deliverability optimization","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Workflow automation","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Integrations with major CRM systems","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If that sounds like what you need, Ava checks all those boxes. \n\n","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/request-demo"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Book a demo","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" and see for yourself!","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When choosing an AI BDR tool, you shouldnâ€™t overlook data privacy and enhanced security features. Since these tools handle sensitive customer information, the software you choose must comply with industry regulations and take robust data protection measures to keep your data safe.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"ðŸ’¡ Many AI software options are still relatively new, which means there may not be a lot of reviews or case studies available online. Thatâ€™s why youâ€™ll have to rely on product demos and free trials to guide your decision-making. Let your BDR team explore the software during demos to see how comfortable they feel with it.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"4. Ensure Effective Training and Change Management","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Now, letâ€™s talk about a common hurdle: ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"resistance to change.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" It might seem odd that people would resist something designed to save them time, but the truth is, many are apprehensive about change. On top of that, thereâ€™s a real fear that AI might replace their jobs.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"To tackle this, help your team understand that mastering AI software is essential for staying relevant in their roles. Highlight how these tools are here to assist and empower your team, not to replace them. With the help of AI, theyâ€™ll become more adept at their jobs and able to focus on higher-level tasks that require human intuition and creativity.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When everyone is on board, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"itâ€™s time for training.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This part goes hand-in-hand with choosing the right software. Not only do you want to review the features of your AI BDR tools, but you also need to ensure that the providers offer excellent onboarding and ongoing support.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Look for vendors that provide comprehensive training sessions, user guides, and easy access to customer support.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"5. Monitor Performance and Optimize Continuously","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Implementing AI BDRs is a strategic investment that requires patience and ongoing refinement. Real progress typically takes timeâ€”usually around 3 to 6 monthsâ€”before you can gauge their full impact on your business goals.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Establish a routine for monitoring your AI BDRs' performance to ensure they consistently deliver value. Use the measurable objectives you set earlier as benchmarks. Are you automating 70% of follow-up emails? Is your lead conversion rate on track to increase by 10%? Regularly review these metrics to spot positive trends or their absences.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"s89BrNXPVJaLx3x6oNnwa","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-10-21T20:59:34.375Z","updatedAt":"2024-10-21T20:59:34.375Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":6,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Frame 1321315145","description":"A dark-haired female AI BDR standing in front of a campaign dashboard. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/s89BrNXPVJaLx3x6oNnwa/4a6219dc434fbda58add5a95328ac114/Frame_1321315145.webp","details":{"size":190252,"image":{"width":3513,"height":2118}},"fileName":"Frame 1321315145.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This is where self-optimizing AI BDRs come in handy.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Tools like Ava will automatically adjust their writing style and outreach schedules over time. This means you wonâ€™t have to constantly micromanage your campaigns and can focus on higher-level strategy while the AI takes care of the day-to-day optimizations.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Get Started with Your AI BDR Solutions","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"AI BDRs complement human BDRs, significantly enhancing your B2B sales operations in todayâ€™s competitive market\n","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Ava can take on the manual tasks from your BDRs or help you build your pipeline from the ground up. Whether your sales team is big or small, Avaâ€™s prospecting can fit right in. Ready to bring her on board? ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/ai-sales-agent"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hire her now","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":".","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},"authors":[{"id":"2BNzbXmPpTiXXI35GfMMwO","slug":"jaspar-carmichael-jack","authorName":"Jaspar Carmichael-Jack","authorDesignation":"Co-Founder & CEO @ Artisan","authorDescription":"Jaspar is an entrepreneur with expertise in sales, marketing, and operations. He founded Artisan in 2023, a company automating workflows with AI employees.","profileImageUrl":"https://ca.slack-edge.com/T05QXKPJQNN-U05RMB3DP1N-83c0c4161322-512","authorSocials":{"twitter":"https://x.com/jasparcjack","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaspar-carmichael-jack"}}],"fields":{"blogNavigation":{"fields":{"contentNavigation":[{"link":"#understanding_ai_in_business_development","label":"Understanding AI in Business Development"},{"link":"#human_bdrs_vs._ai_bdrs","label":"Human BDRs vs. AI BDRs"},{"link":